<title>MALAYSIA: TABLE-The Store year net down 42.6 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-The Store year net down 42.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  10.84   vs	  18.93</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 17.4    vs	  30.30</p>
<p>    Turnover		   875.75   vs	 688.90</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    21.59   vs	  29.44</p>
<p>    Minorities	  add    0.24   vs   add   0.02</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	    nil    vs	   nil</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	12.0    vs	  12.0</p>
<p>NOTE - The Store Corporation Bhd is engaged in the operation of department stores and supermarkets.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
</text>
